#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:50
msgid ""
"`Ctrl-X` at the input prompt opens the current input in "
"`$VISUAL`/`$EDITOR` (falling back to vim) and loads the edited text back;"
" a non-zero exit or a failed launch leaves the input untouched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:53
msgid "0.9.7 - 2026-07-16"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:56
msgid ""
"Resume this project's latest session with `-c` (also `--last`, "
"`--latest`), matched by working directory. Mutually exclusive with "
"`--resume`, which still takes a UID or resolves the most recent session "
"across all projects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:59
msgid ""
"Rebuild the interactive REPL around a single persistent prompt-toolkit "
"application: live activity, input, approval prompts, selectors, the "
"`/diff` viewer, and the status bar now share one app, while completed "
"output prints above it into native terminal scrollback."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:60
msgid ""
"Define `Ctrl-C` uniformly across that app: cancel an approval prompt, "
"clear the current input at an idle prompt, or interrupt a running turn. "
"Exit stays on `Ctrl-D` at an empty prompt and `/exit`."
msgstr ""

